        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b><u>Game Rules</u></b>\n\nMove to the start position to begin the
        countdown. \n\nGrab a hammer with either controller or hand, hit the most
        pink pigs first to score points, avoid red pigs. \n\nThe player with the
        highest score before time runs out wins."
